    "space": "O(h)",
    "pitfall": "Returning the bent path upward (it isn't a valid path for the parent), and initializing best to 0 when every value is negative.",
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def maxPathSum(self, root: Optional[TreeNode]) -> int:\n        best = float(\"-inf\")\n\n        def gain(node):\n            nonlocal best\n            if not node:\n                return 0\n            left = max(gain(node.left), 0)\n            right = max(gain(node.right), 0)\n            best = max(best, node.val + left + right)\n            return node.val + max(left, right)\n\n        gain(root)\n        return best"
